    <ShapeStyle Type="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD.Shape.WbLDVariableAccessShape" Assembly="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD" Alpha="255" Background="#FFFFFFFF" BackgroundGradient="#FFFFFFFF" FontColor="windowtext" DisplayMode="NameAndAlias" Key="[0,3],[1,3],[1,5],[1,5]" />
    <ShapeStyle Type="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD.Shape.WbLdSubBranchShape" Assembly="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD" FontColor="windowtext" DisplayMode="NameAndAlias" Key="[0,3],[4,3]" />
    <ShapeStyle Type="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD.Shape.WbLdRungShape" Assembly="ISaGRAF.Workbench.Mlge.LanguageContainer.LD" PowerRailColor="Silver" DisplayLabel="false" RungColor="WhiteSmoke" CommentColor="White" LabelColor="LightGoldenrodYellow" DisplayComment="true" Key="[0,7]">
      <Text>As long as siemensHandshakeReg is not "TransferRead", keep "partAvailable" flag reset to 0. this will be true for as long as seimensHandshakeReg is both 2 (Transfer done, written by this controller) or 0 (Transfer IDLE, which is written Seimens when there's no part available) </Text>
      <RtfText>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green128\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs17 As long as siemensHandshakeReg is not "TransferRead", keep "partAvailable" flag reset to 0. this will be true for as long as seimensHandshakeReg is both 2 (Transfer done, written by this controller) or 0 (Transfer IDLE, which is written Seimens when there's no part available) \par
}
</RtfText>
    </ShapeStyle>
